<title>NETHERLANDS: TWENTSCHE KABEL RAISES H1 NET, DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>TWENTSCHE KABEL RAISES H1 NET, DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>HAAKSBERGEN, Netherlands 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     2.83 vs   2.50</p>
<p>    Net profit			    22.0  vs  19.3</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)	0.80 vs   0.54</p>
<p>    Turnover			     392.3  vs 307.9</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    33.7  vs  29.0</p>
<p>    Interest gains			 0.6  vs   1.3</p>
<p>    Tax				     12.3  vs  11.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Cable maker NV Twentsche Kabel Holding previously</p>
<p>said it expected further growth in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
